<speak>That makes sense for the navigation. I think I was treating the notification and the stored document as the same place. Next time I'll use the computer and look at the heading first. I also need to stop opening several tabs, because then I don't know which one I'm returning to. My daughter laughs when she sees the top of my browser. There are always little tabs from things I intended to finish, and half of them are so narrow that I can't read the titles anymore.</speak>